        "text": "Step 3: Solve Case 1: \\( x+5 = 3x-6 \\)\n\\[ x + 5 = 3x - 6 \\]\n\\[ 5 + 6 = 3x - x \\]\n\\[ 11 = 2x \\]\n\\[ x = \\frac{11}{2} \\]"
